<title>UK: WGZ-BANK SETS 500 MLN MARK NOV 2001 STEP-UP BOND.</title>
<headline>WGZ-BANK SETS 500 MLN MARK NOV 2001 STEP-UP BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WGZ-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WGZ-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.125     MATURITY    14.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    14.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING    DUSS	REOFFER    PAR	 DENOMS (K)  500</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 14.NOV.97 WHEN COUPON STEPS-UP TO 5.0 PCT</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER IF NOT CALLED AT PAR.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom  +44 171 542 7970</p>
</text>
